Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.45,0:06:34.58,TS - Handwriting,,0,0,0,,Дабыл
Dialogue: 2,0:06:34.45,0:06:34.58,TS - Handwriting,,0,0,0,,Ыңғайлылық
